  "items": [
    {
      "name": "What Glaucoma Actually Is",
      "char_file": "물방울_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Fluid inside your eye,",
        "called aqueous humor,",
        "",
        "builds up when it",
        "cannot drain properly",
        "",
        "raising pressure that presses",
        "on the optic nerve"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "It's Different From Macular Degeneration",
      "char_file": "독서안경_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Macular degeneration blurs",
        "your central vision first",
        "",
        "Glaucoma creeps in",
        "from the edges instead",
        "",
        "which is why most people",
        "do not notice it early on"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Normal Eye Pressure Doesn't Rule It Out",
      "char_file": "혈압계_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Many people with glaucoma",
        "test in the normal IOP range",
        "",
        "it's called",
        "normal-tension glaucoma",
        "",
        "a pressure test alone can miss it -",
        "ask for a visual field exam too"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Your Risk Is Higher If...",
      "char_file": "가족력_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "You're over 40,",
        "have a family history,",
        "",
        "or you're Black or Hispanic -",
        "",
        "glaucoma is 6 to 8 times",
        "more common in Black Americans"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Watch These Habits",
      "char_file": "스마트폰_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Head-down yoga poses",
        "like downward dog",
        "",
        "can spike eye pressure",
        "within a minute",
        "",
        "Regular aerobic exercise",
        "lowers it instead"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "How To Manage It",
      "char_file": "운동화_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "A baseline eye exam",
        "at age 40 is the standard",
        "",
        "advice from the American",
        "Academy of Ophthalmology",
        "",
        "Moderate aerobic exercise",
        "like walking or swimming helps too"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "These Signs Mean The ER",
      "char_file": "폭죽_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Sudden severe eye pain",
        "with headache and nausea,",
        "",
        "or rainbow-colored halos",
        "around lights",
        "",
        "can signal an acute attack -",
        "vision loss can happen within a day or two"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "closing": {
    "headline": [
      [
        "Glaucoma often progresses",
        "without any warning"
      ],
      [
        "Catching it early",
        "protects the vision you have left"
      ]
    ],
    "tip": [
      "Normal eye pressure doesn't rule it out -",
